01:12:56,470 --> 01:13:02,470
National Treasure: Book of Secrets is a 2007 American action-adventure film
directed by Jon Turteltaub and produced by Jerry Bruckheimer.

11
01:20:14,117 --> 01:20:20,117
It is a sequel to the 2004 film National Treasure and is the
second film of the National Treasure franchise.

12
01:27:31,764 --> 01:27:37,764
The film stars Nicolas Cage in the lead role, Jon Voight, Harvey Keitel, Ed
Harris, Diane Kruger, Justin Bartha, Bruce Greenwood and Helen Mirren.

13
01:34:49,411 --> 01:34:55,411
