Studios Motion Pictures released it in North America on December 21.

14
01:42:07,058 --> 01:42:13,058
Like its predecessor, it received mixed reviews from critics but was a commercial success,
grossing $459 million worldwide, becoming the ninth-highest-grossing film of 2007.

